// REQUIRES: host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/run-golden.py --src %S/Inputs/own/goto.gopp %S/Inputs/own/goto.out
// GOLDEN: by-hand
// P04.09 review R3: a goto leaves every scope inside its label's statement
// list, as break and continue do, and in that list what was made after the
// label (a jump back over a declaration) or since the statement that holds
// the goto began (a jump forward, the temporaries of an if header). The
// drops print (Go++ only), so the output is the order of the ends; under
// `check-run-leaks` nothing leaks.
